# Storybook and Chromatic

All Cartera frontends ship Storybook. Chromatic runs in CI on `dev` / `main`.

## Do

- Put stories next to the component (`Component.stories.tsx`)
- Cover empty, loading, error, and the primary filled state
- Keep axe checks in unit tests for interactive chrome
- Treat a Chromatic failure as a real UI regression unless the change is intentional (then accept the snapshot in Chromatic)

## Do not

- Put stories only under a distant `src/stories/` dump unless the file is a composition demo
- Skip stories for a new shared primitive
- Disable Chromatic to "make CI green"
